      "reason": "This is a review of observational studies (cohort and cross-sectional) investigating transmission rates, not a review of intervention effects (e.g., randomized controlled trials of a specific treatment or intervention), so PICO comparisons are not applicable."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
